BT /F2 12.7 Tf 0 0.392 0.455 rg 47 622.8 Td (7. Questions that can bring people together) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 600.7 Td (- What do we all want to be different about Chico one year from now?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 581.8 Td (- What does a safe neighborhood mean to a housed neighbor ... and to someone sleeping outdoors?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 562.9 Td (- Which needs do we agree are urgent, even if we disagree about the methods?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 544.0 Td (- When does a shelter rule help someone, and when might it prevent access?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 525.1 Td (- What would change if people with lived experience helped design the options?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 506.2 Td (- What outcomes would tell us that fewer people are actually homeless, rather than simply less visible?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 487.3 Td (- What is one action we could take without asking anyone here to change their political identity?) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.7 Tf 0 0.392 0.455 rg 47 459.4 Td (8. What we hope participants take away) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.8 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 437.3 Td (We are not asking Chico to agree on every cause, every service model, or every city policy. We are asking neighbors) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.8 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 424.1 Td (to see one another as people and to examine what our shared values require of our actions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.8 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 404.9 Td (One night does not end homelessness. It can, however, help us listen differently, speak differently, and work toward) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.8 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 391.7 Td (choices that result in more people safely housed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.8 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 372.5 Td (The core idea from De Jong is not that we need better slogans. It is that values become meaningful only when they) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.8 Tf 0.14 0.20 0.27 rg 47 359.3 Td (shape decisions. Campout for Compassion is an opportunity to begin that conversation ... together.) Tj ET
